commit b714f8046ea7eba348d1801ac48b3f87d22f3c8f

C03: the YouTube resolver uses the android client, whose stream URLs play in the local player (MUSIC1555)

MUSIC1553 measured that the reviewed playback was proposed, approved and resolved with its title, but mpv never played: the stream URL of yt-dlp's default client (android_vr) answers 403 Forbidden to the player's HTTP client. A root probe showed that with --extractor-args youtube:player_client=android the resolved itag 18 URL plays directly in mpv (WASAPI audio and video), while web, tv, ios and mweb do not. YouTubeMpvAdapter passes that client to yt-dlp; nothing else changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


